# PENDING - fails today. RFC 5961 3.2: in a synchronized state, a RST whose
# sequence number is inside the receive window but not exactly RCV.NXT is
# answered with a challenge ACK and otherwise ignored - a blind attacker only
# has to land in the window to reset a connection otherwise. A RST exactly at
# RCV.NXT still resets it, silently.
0      listen 8080
+0     < S 0:0(0) win 65535 <mss 1460>
+0     > S. 0:0(0) ack 1 <mss 1460>
+0.005 < . 1:1(0) ack 1 win 65535
+0     accept

+0.010 < R 101:101(0) win 0
+0     > . 1:1(0) ack 1
+0     state ESTABLISHED
+0.010 < R 1:1(0) win 0
+0     state CLOSED
